{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the <strong>BrokenLore</strong> saga comes a new first-person psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A longer and darker spin-off of <strong>DON\u2019T WATCH</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/28d823e49b22f6311a4c1b79a847c5e7.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/28d823e49b22f6311a4c1b79a847c5e7.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/28d823e49b22f6311a4c1b79a847c5e7.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>BrokenLore: DON\u2019T LIE</strong>, step into the fragile world of Junko, a young woman attempting to reconnect with Shinji and Hideo, two patients she once met in a rehabilitation center. Confined to her small apartment, she struggles between daily calls, fleeting moments of intimacy, and her own destructive compulsions. Her reliance on medication slowly unravels reality itself, leading her into warped visions and liminal spaces where nothing remains stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/71b832f47de4c17ee05f0e72f7374c8e.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/71b832f47de4c17ee05f0e72f7374c8e.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/71b832f47de4c17ee05f0e72f7374c8e.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person psychological horror: a story-driven descent into paranoia and delusion with realistic atmosphere and detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration phases: search Junko\u2019s apartment, eerie locations, and unsettling liminal spaces for clues, objects, and fragments of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth sequences: hide and remain silent as hallucinations stalk you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: survive confrontations with Junko\u2019s most terrifying visions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic storytelling: small choices, conversations, and lies subtly influence Junko\u2019s fragile state of mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/b5c1be5c2d4268209fc92007b2af164a.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/b5c1be5c2d4268209fc92007b2af164a.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/b5c1be5c2d4268209fc92007b2af164a.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantasy Boy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junko plays a retro side-scroller called <i>Fantasy Boy</i> to calm herself. <br>These playable segments are directly integrated into the experience.<br><br>At first innocent and nostalgic, they eventually merge with her reality in unsettling ways, colliding with the hyper-realistic world and turning it into something grotesque.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/933a6d18de428d4578a09f3fcd1ddf5c.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/933a6d18de428d4578a09f3fcd1ddf5c.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/933a6d18de428d4578a09f3fcd1ddf5c.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Junko\u2019s eyes alone, you drift between suffocating everyday life and distorted hallucinations, where glitches, mutations, and whispers of unseen eyes follow you at every step.<br><br>Every glance in the mirror might reveal something new.<br><br>Every word spoken might alter the fragile balance.<br><br>Every lie brings you closer to what you fear most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/ee8a890200d3b20fca31ad2707b76770.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/ee8a890200d3b20fca31ad2707b76770.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/ee8a890200d3b20fca31ad2707b76770.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what really happened in <strong>BrokenLore: DON\u2019T WATCH</strong>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/65dd4089a5ab99f4d3d726acef0ec22e.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/65dd4089a5ab99f4d3d726acef0ec22e.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/65dd4089a5ab99f4d3d726acef0ec22e.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust what you see...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust what you hear... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above all, DON\u2019T LIE...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886200?t=1772815902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/d0598d457ae48ff71ab36437a11baf2265db163a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772815902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/640a198b59f14fb037f7e7569ed53bfd8c8df4ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772815902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/640a198b59f14fb037f7e7569ed53bfd8c8df4ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772815902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the <strong>BrokenLore</strong> saga comes a new first-person psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A longer and darker spin-off of <strong>DON\u2019T WATCH</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/28d823e49b22f6311a4c1b79a847c5e7.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/28d823e49b22f6311a4c1b79a847c5e7.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/28d823e49b22f6311a4c1b79a847c5e7.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>BrokenLore: DON\u2019T LIE</strong>, step into the fragile world of Junko, a young woman attempting to reconnect with Shinji and Hideo, two patients she once met in a rehabilitation center. Confined to her small apartment, she struggles between daily calls, fleeting moments of intimacy, and her own destructive compulsions. Her reliance on medication slowly unravels reality itself, leading her into warped visions and liminal spaces where nothing remains stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/71b832f47de4c17ee05f0e72f7374c8e.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/71b832f47de4c17ee05f0e72f7374c8e.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/71b832f47de4c17ee05f0e72f7374c8e.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person psychological horror: a story-driven descent into paranoia and delusion with realistic atmosphere and detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration phases: search Junko\u2019s apartment, eerie locations, and unsettling liminal spaces for clues, objects, and fragments of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth sequences: hide and remain silent as hallucinations stalk you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: survive confrontations with Junko\u2019s most terrifying visions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic storytelling: small choices, conversations, and lies subtly influence Junko\u2019s fragile state of mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/b5c1be5c2d4268209fc92007b2af164a.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/b5c1be5c2d4268209fc92007b2af164a.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/b5c1be5c2d4268209fc92007b2af164a.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantasy Boy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junko plays a retro side-scroller called <i>Fantasy Boy</i> to calm herself. <br>These playable segments are directly integrated into the experience.<br><br>At first innocent and nostalgic, they eventually merge with her reality in unsettling ways, colliding with the hyper-realistic world and turning it into something grotesque.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/933a6d18de428d4578a09f3fcd1ddf5c.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/933a6d18de428d4578a09f3fcd1ddf5c.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/933a6d18de428d4578a09f3fcd1ddf5c.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Junko\u2019s eyes alone, you drift between suffocating everyday life and distorted hallucinations, where glitches, mutations, and whispers of unseen eyes follow you at every step.<br><br>Every glance in the mirror might reveal something new.<br><br>Every word spoken might alter the fragile balance.<br><br>Every lie brings you closer to what you fear most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/ee8a890200d3b20fca31ad2707b76770.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/ee8a890200d3b20fca31ad2707b76770.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/ee8a890200d3b20fca31ad2707b76770.mp4?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what really happened in <strong>BrokenLore: DON\u2019T WATCH</strong>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/65dd4089a5ab99f4d3d726acef0ec22e.poster.avif?t=1772815902\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/65dd4089a5ab99f4d3d726acef0ec22e.webm?t=1772815902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886200/extras/65dd408